---
// "Test runner" scroll progress. The spec list is rebuilt per page from [data-spec] sections.
---

<aside class="runner" aria-label="Scroll progress" transition:persist="runner">
  <div class="runner-head"><span class="pulse"></span><span class="runner-now">Running…</span><span class="runner-count"></span></div>
  <div class="runner-list"><div><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"></ul></div></div>
  <div class="runner-bar"><i></i></div>
</aside>
